{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08dbfe5ddc486dec386dace7278fb86473155bcc396458e2e5b52a02b2d0a830","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":125,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಯೆಹೋವನೇ ವಿಶ್ವಾಸಿಗಳ ಆಶ್ರಯ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಯಾತ್ರಾಗೀತೆ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನಲ್ಲಿ ಭರವಸೆ ಇಡುವವರು,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಚೀಯೋನ್ ಪರ್ವತದ ಹಾಗೆ ಇದ್ದಾರೆ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅದು ಕದಲುವುದಿಲ್ಲ, ಸದಾ ಸ್ಥಿರವಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಪರ್ವತಗಳು ಯೆರೂಸಲೇಮಿನ ಸುತ್ತಲೂ ಹೇಗೋ ಹಾಗೆಯೇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನು ಈಗಿನಿಂದ ಸದಾಕಾಲವೂ ತನ್ನ ಜನರ ಸುತ್ತಲೂ ಇರುವನು.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ದುಷ್ಟರ ದಂಡಾಧಿಕಾರವು ನೀತಿವಂತರ ಸ್ವತ್ತಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಉಳಿಯುವುದೇ ಇಲ್ಲ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಉಳಿದರೆ ನೀತಿವಂತರೂ ಅಕ್ರಮಕ್ಕೆ ಕೈ ಹಾಕಬಹುದು.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನೇ, ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವರೂ, ಯಥಾರ್ಥಚಿತ್ತರೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆಗಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ಉಪಕಾರಮಾಡು.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನು ಡೊಂಕುದಾರಿ ಹಿಡಿದವರನ್ನು,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಪಾತಕಿಗಳು ಹೋಗುವ ಸ್ಥಳಕ್ಕೆ ನಡೆಸುವನು.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲರಿಗೆ ಶುಭವುಂಟಾಗಲಿ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/125.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/126.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/124.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}